<view class="container">
  <view class="tip">
    若您是被提及的企业/当事人，或您发现某条内容失实，可在此处提交申诉。请尽量提供可核验材料的链接或文件名，便于复核。
  </view>

  <view class="form">
    <picker mode="selector"
            range="{{typeOptions}}"
            value="{{typeIndex}}"
            bindchange="onTypePick">
      <view class="picker-row">
        <view class="picker-label">申诉类型<text class="required">*</text></view>
        <view class="picker-value {{form.type ? '' : 'placeholder'}}">
          {{form.type || '请选择申诉类型'}}
        </view>
        <l-icon name="pull-down" size="28" color="#999999" />
      </view>
    </picker>
    <view class="field-gap">
      <l-input label-width="200"
               clear="{{true}}"
               bind:linblur="bindTarget"
               label="涉及条目"
               placeholder="公司/机构名称或条目编号"
               required="{{true}}">
      </l-input>
    </view>
    <view class="field-gap">
      <l-input label-width="200"
               clear="{{true}}"
               bind:linblur="bindContact"
               label="联系方式"
               placeholder="邮箱或手机号，便于回复（选填）">
      </l-input>
    </view>
    <view class="field-gap">
      <l-textarea indicator="{{true}}"
                  maxlength="500"
                  bind:linblur="bindContent"
                  placeholder="请描述申诉理由，并附可核验材料的链接或说明">
      </l-textarea>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="actions">
    <l-button type="primary" bind:lintap="submit">提交申诉</l-button>
  </view>

  <l-toast />
</view>
